{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For I have seen the face of Elohim.</b> After the custom of visiting dignitaries, as it says: וְלֹא יֵרָאוּ פָנַי רֵיקָם (Exodus 23:15)." "<b>And you have received me.</b> That you received me with a favorable countenance, as in וְהִרְצָה אֹתוֹ לִקְבָּל פָּנָיו (Malachi 1:8), וְלֹא יִשָּׂא פָּנִים בַּנֶּאֱצָח (Deuteronomy 10:17), וְלֹא תִשָּׂא פְנֵי אִישׁ (Deuteronomy 1:17). And for this reason too it is fitting that I should anticipate your face with a gift, in order to fulfill what is said: וְלֹא יֵרָאוּ פָנַי רֵיקָם (Exodus 23:15)."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:09.676036749Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}